# A bare write through the transparent caller place changes that local place only (the book, #binding-caller-place:
# the name is bound to «a suitable available local place of the caller»; the inputs of a called Structure are
# activation-local places). run's input x takes the value of the graph field Source\x, which Holder also holds;
# work writes x := 9 into run's x. Observed\seen 9; Source\x and Holder's cell keep 1.
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
    Holder:
        int: h 0
    Source:
        int: x 1
)
sub: work ()
    x := 9
sub: run (int: x 0)
    @: shared node[0]
    work()
    shared\Observed\seen := x
sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Holder[0] := @(shared\Source\x)
    run(shared\Source\x)
main()
